                              T H E   W A L L

                       version 1.01 for Excelsior! BBS
                       Copyright ©1994 by Rod Schnell


There are plenty of graffiti wall doors for Excelsior! I never could find one
that had the features and speed I wanted, so I decided to write my own. The
Wall is written in C for speed and allows selection of a color to paint with.


Installing The Wall
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
   Nothing could be simpler, just copy TheWall.data to your BBS:DATA directory
   and copy TheWall to anywhere you like. Then install TheWall somewhere as an
   Excelsior! C door. BBS:TEXT/ENGLISH/Welcome.user is a good place to install
   The Wall. You can also run it from a logon door like Rot_Logon.


Using The Wall
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
   Eh? No need for long docs, just install it and hit the Local Logon button.


Future
~~~~~~
   If I receive suggestions I like there will be new versions. Otherwise, who
   knows?

 
